    "created_at": "2015-10-06T08:07:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-06T08:07:32Z",
    "body": "I noticed one more thing. The case-insensitive thing does not apply to XHTML per spec, but certainly we want the UA stylesheet to work right for uppercase values in XHTML. So we need to continue to use `i` in the UA stylesheet.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
